1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,810
Qiu Siping said

25
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:57,370
that this cave belonged to an ancient cultivator.

26
00:01:57,120 --> 00:02:00,210
Maybe one of these texts has hints about the Ji Realm.

27
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,570
Found it !

28
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,970
There is only a single way to overcome

29
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,210
the limits of the Ji Realm:

30
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:18,450
Abandon the cultivation the Ji Realm granted you.

31
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:20,050
Shatter your cultivation.

32
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,530
After shattering your cultivation,

33
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,290
the Ji Realm will dissipate.

34
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:26,530
This is the only way to escape the Ji Realm.

35
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,010
Cultivate from zero

36
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,770
and redo all your breakthroughs.

37
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:33,850
Does that mean that you need to discard your Ancient God body ?

38
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,330
Not necessarily.

39
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:39,890
The Divine Path... So this is the Divine Path !

40
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:42,970
Create an avatar to cultivate simultaneously with the main body

41
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:45,450
and merge the two bodies to form a Nascent Soul.

42
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:52,130
I can use the Divine Path to create an avatar and form my Nascent Soul.

43
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:54,250
How is that any different ?

44
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:57,410
Master, the avatar must also cultivate from scratch

45
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:59,090
to the Nascent Soul breakthrough

46
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,610
and merge with the original body to attempt to form a Nascent Soul.

47
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,610
I wasn't able to form an avatar before

48
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,810
because I didn't have enough pills and artifacts.

49
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:08,170
With the harvest from the Land of the Ancient God,

50
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:10,530
this looks like the perfect time and place to try.

51
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,450
It's too risky !

52
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:15,010
The avatar's lifespan will only be 30 years !

53
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,410
If you don't form a Nascent Soul within 30 years,

54
00:03:17,160 --> 00:03:19,490
it will all be for nothing !

55
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,300
Besides...

56
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,810
No need to discuss this any further,

57
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:23,330
I must form Nascent Soul in order to get revenge.

58
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:46,330
The country of Chu is at the north of the Burning Fire country

59
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,650
and at the east of the country of Xuanwu.

60
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:50,970
It also shares a border with the Sea of Devils

61
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,890
next to the Broken Rocks Mountains.

62
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,690
Its territory is vast

63
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:57,770
and is populated by many cultivators.

64
00:04:58,080 --> 00:05:00,290
Even if it's just a rank 3 country,

65
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:04,930
it's at the pinnacle of rank 3 countries thanks to the Cloud Sky Sect,

66
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:06,530
Cloud Sky Sect
Country of Chu

67
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:08,090
a major sect specialized in alchemy.

68
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:14,010
It will eventually produce a Soul Formation cultivator and rise to rank 4.

69
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:20,530
Cheng Fei
Sword Qi Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

70
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:26,410
Cheng Ling
Early stage Foundation Establishment

71
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,890
We are still 1000 li away,

72
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,410
why did we land here ?

73
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:29,330
If I want to become a disciple

74
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:31,010
then why do I have to walk ?

75
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,810
Keep your voice down,

76
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,890
everyone else is walking too.

77
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:37,090
This is a show of respect towards the sect.

78
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:45,290
Big Brother, why do you want me to join the Cloud Sky Sect ?

79
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:47,010
I don’t want to refine pills,

80
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:49,250
I want to join Sword Qi Sect like you !

81
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,730
Don't say that.

82
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:52,330
You know that

83
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:54,810
the Cloud Sky Sect is the strongest in the country of Chu.

84
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:57,690
The Cloud Sky Sect once refined a grade 5 pill.

85
00:05:57,880 --> 00:06:00,730
In order to buy that pill, a rank 4 country

86
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:03,890
specially created a formation for the Cloud Sky Sect

87
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:07,010
that even ordinary rank 4 countries would struggle to break.

88
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,650
What do you think now ?

89
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:12,570
Well, that does pique my interest a bit.

90
00:06:12,850 --> 00:06:14,270
Very well,

91
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,890
once I join the Cloud Sky Sect,

92
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:16,810
I will make pills

93
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,090
to help you in your cultivation.

94
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,450
You...

95
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:23,690
Do you think entering Cloud Sky Sect will be easy ?

96
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:26,010
They only recruit every 30 years.

97
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:29,450
Not only do major families of Chu send their descendents here

98
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:31,930
but many rogue cultivators also try their chance.

99
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,850
Thousands will participate

100
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,690
but less than 10 will be accepted.

101
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,090
Don’t worry,

102
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:38,410
a girl as adorable as me

103
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,530
is sure to be chosen.

104
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:42,050
You might not know

105
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:44,170
but the Cloud Sky Sect's recruitment is quite peculiar.

106
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:47,010
Unlike other sects that value talent and spiritual roots,

107
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:48,690
they value fate.

108
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,090
Big Brother, look at that person !

109
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:52,250
Why are his clothes are so funny ?

110
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:58,010
Hey, are you here to join the sect as well ?

111
00:06:57,920 --> 00:07:00,570
Why are you dressed like a beggar ?

112
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:06,290
Hey, are you mute ?

113
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,490
I’m talking to you.

114
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,770
It's a pointless question.

115
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:11,050
Why else would I be heading to the Cloud Sky Sect ?

116
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:11,210
Wang Lin's avatar
3rd layer of Qi Condensation

117
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,370
You...

118
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:16,010
You’ve always been spoiled for being cute

119
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,770
but you rarely get ignored.

120
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,610
Let’s go.

121
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:27,250
It’s been so long since I felt the fatigue of a mortal.

122
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,690
Master,

123
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:31,850
why must you participate in this disciple selection ?

124
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,290
I came out of the Sea of Devils

125
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,850
specifically for this place.

126
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,610
If I can become a sect disciple,

127
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:39,130
I will use the Cloud Sky Sect's help

128
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:41,290
to form my Nascent Soul.

129
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:48,930
The will of the heavens is unpredictable...

130
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:52,970
I never thought that I'd join a sect again one day.

131
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,290
Incredible !

132
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:05,450
Among the candidates

133
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:07,690
there are 2nd and 3rd layers of Qi Condensation

134
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:10,810
and also people up to Core Formation.

135
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:34,610
Zhou Lin
Cloud Sky Sect 9th generation disciple
Early stage Core Formation

136
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:36,770
If you wish to join the Cloud Sky Sect,

137
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,730
your seniority will be low.

138
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:42,850
If you’re not willing, then leave now.

139
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:48,930
Since no one left,

140
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,570
then let's start.

141
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:54,810
The Cloud Sky Sect’s disciple selection begins now !

142
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,650
It’s starting, it’s starting !

143
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:09,530
Using whatever method you choose,

144
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:13,810
as long as you can feel what substance is inside this pillar

145
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:17,290
then you'll be qualified.

146
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:20,770
You have 6 hours.

147
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,130
I saw nothing !

148
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,530
Watch me !

149
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:53,050
My artifact !

150
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,090
He lost his artifact ?

151
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:57,170
You may use any method you can think of.

152
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:58,930
Don’t worry,

153
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:02,450
your artifacts will be returned after the selection.

154
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:04,450
My turn !

155
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:06,090
I’ll try too !

156
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:08,810
Me too !

157
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,490
I don't believe it !

158
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:20,370
Master, why aren’t you moving yet ?

159
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:24,090
There clearly is some kind of restriction to prevent anyone from probing.

160
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,650
What a coincidence,

161
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:30,090
you’re an Enlightened of Ancient God restrictions.

162
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:32,570
Even if this avatar doesn't have your cultivation,

163
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:36,210
you still have all the memories of the Ancient God.

164
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,370
Master is truly impressive.

165
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:41,450
Even without his cultivation or Ji Realm,

166
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:44,210
he still has a domineering aura around him.

167
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:52,930
11 Eleven pills,

168
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:55,370
11 jade slips

169
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:58,410
and 11 tokens engraved with pill furnaces.

170
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,610
Why are there different items ?

171
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:02,010
Wait...

172
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:06,650
the Cloud Sky Sect isn't selecting experts in restrictions.

173
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:12,050
Someone found it ?

174
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:12,850
Look over there !

175
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,330
How did she do it ?

176
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:15,490
She's no ordinary girl.

177
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:18,130
So you can actually take these things out ?

178
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:21,330
You pass.

179
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:25,730
So the real selection has nothing to do with the candidate.

180
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:28,210
It's the items inside that choose the disciples.

181
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,810
The 3 kinds of items

182
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:32,010
correspond to 3 different outcomes.

183
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,730
What are the outcomes ?

184
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:37,050
We won't know until we try.

185
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:44,210
I... I passed !

186
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:48,210
It's a pity this pill is of the fire element.

187
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:50,930
Otherwise, I could've been your teacher.

188
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:54,450
Congratulations on becoming an inner disciple of the Cloud Sky Sect.

189
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,130
Keep this pill.

190
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:59,610
The jade slip means you pass this trial

191
00:11:56,640 --> 00:11:58,690
You will give it to your teacher

192
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:01,970
and the pill makes you an inner disciple directly.

193
00:11:58,560 --> 00:12:00,450
to thank him for accepting you as disciple.

194
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:05,130
Then what is the token ?

195
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:08,290
Only 1 hour is left before the end of the test.

196
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,490
I can tell you

197
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:13,570
that there are 4 types of items in this pillar.

198
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:18,690
Jade slips, pills, tokens, and a pill furnace.

199
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,890
A pill furnace ?

200
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,930
Those who obtain jade slips

201
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,210
pass this test.

202
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:26,210
Those who obtain a pill

203
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:28,090
directly become inner sect disciples

204
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:29,690
Those who obtain a token

205
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,850
also become inner disciples

206
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:36,010
and can exchange the token for a grade 3 pill.

207
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,610
If you can obtain the pill furnace,

208
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:43,370
you will become a core disciple directly under the Sect Leader.

209
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:47,250
Master, quickly find it !

210
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,970
Everyone will admire you !

211
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,650
You'll have countless pills !

212
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:51,770
I won't waste time.

213
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,570
Being an inner disciple is enough.

214
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,690
Water element !?

215
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:01,730
Will you be my disciple ?

216
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:08,650
Then I’ll accept this gift.

217
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,610
I got one too !

218
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:12,530
I also have one !

219
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:13,890
You got one ?

220
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,690
Look at mine !

221
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,650
The Dragonborn Furnace !

222
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,890
A Sect Leader disciple will appear !--

223
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:32,210
Who is this lucky ?

224
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:32,810
Look up there !

225
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:37,810
What happened ?

226
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,530
Still, he failed.

227
00:13:40,160 --> 00:13:42,490
Over the past 8000 years of the Cloud Sky Sect

228
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:46,130
only 6 Seniors ever got the pill furnace.

229
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,810
Sometimes, you need a little luck in life.

230
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:55,290
But you can't rely on luck alone.

231
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,970
This concludes this test of the disciple selection.

232
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:00,770
Those who failed will be escorted out.

233
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,570
Those who obtained items,

234
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:04,090
follow me up the mountain.

235
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,290
Understood !

236
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:20,290
Such a domineering pill furnace...

237
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:29,290
The buildings are entirely made of jade.

238
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:32,250
This alchemy sect must be really wealthy !

239
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:43,250
Such abundant spiritual energy !

240
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:46,010
The Cloud Sky Sect really is an excellent place for cultivation.

241
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:08,410
Song Qing
Cloud Sky Sect Leader
Middle stage Nascent Soul

242
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:11,130
9th generation disciple Zhou Lin, pays respects to Sect Leader.

243
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:16,610
Here are the 6 who passed the disciple selection.

244
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,970
3 obtained jade slips

245
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:20,490
2 obtained pills

246
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:22,050
and 1 obtained a token.

247
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:26,930
Those who obtained jade slips

248
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:30,610
will have to undergo a second test

249
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:34,210
to decide whether they become inner disciples.

250
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:34,770
Understood.

251
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:36,770
Those who obtained pills

252
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:39,290
will take 9th generation disciples as their teacher.

253
00:15:39,640 --> 00:15:42,530
Junior Sun, you choose your disciple first.

254
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,330
Thank you, Sect Leader.

255
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:53,010
Sun Zhenwei
9th generation Cloud Sky Sect disciple
Late stage Core Formation

256
00:15:57,280 --> 00:16:00,610
Sect Leader, disciple wishes to take this person as disciple.

257
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:02,770
He obtained a water element pill

258
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:05,570
that perfectly matches my current needs for alchemy.

259
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:12,090
Junior Sun, are you willing to yield this person ?

260
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:15,530
Zhou Lin is Elder Li’s only disciple.

261
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:17,170
Naturally, I wish to help him.

262
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,130
Thank you.

263
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:22,210
Then who will you choose ?

264
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:27,530
Disciple pays respects to Teacher.

265
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,730
You haven’t obtained inner disciple qualifications yet.

266
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:32,330
You can't choose your teacher yet.

267
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:37,370
This girl is quite clever.

268
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,770
Although you only obtained a jade slip,

269
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:41,610
your courage is commendable.

270
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:44,810
I’ll make an exception and take you as my disciple.

271
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,730
As for the inner disciple,

272
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:49,890
I'll take him.

273
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:50,890
Sect Leader,

274
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:52,290
is this acceptable ?

275
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:54,530
This... this is against the sect's rules.

276
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:57,450
No problem, no problem.

277
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:59,850
Since Junior Sun has spoken,

278
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,050
then let it be so.

279
00:17:04,120 --> 00:17:04,770
But...

280
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:05,890
You're dismissed.

281
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:07,410
Understood.

282
00:17:14,600 --> 00:17:17,530
The Cloud Sky Sect is divided into the inner and outer sect.

283
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:19,450
The inner sect refines pills

284
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,930
and the outer sect guards it.

285
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:23,170
Since you are an inner disciple,

286
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:26,170
you will focus on alchemy.

287
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:29,370
Such extravagance !

288
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:31,850
There are so many precious plants

289
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:33,770
in this disciple's garden !

290
00:17:34,320 --> 00:17:35,370
Wang Lin,

291
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:37,610
you are my first disciple.

292
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:39,010
From now on,

293
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:41,170
you will live in this room.

294
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:43,490
I will go in seclusion for several months

295
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:45,130
to absorb the Water Spirit Pill.

296
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,690
You will find

297
00:17:46,640 --> 00:17:49,330
my insights on alchemy inside this jade slip

298
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:50,610
along with pill formulas.

299
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:52,250
Read them for yourself.

300
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:55,930
I will teach you personally when I come out.

301
00:17:57,120 --> 00:17:58,770
You may freely use

302
00:17:58,720 --> 00:18:00,330
the herbs in this garden.

303
00:18:00,280 --> 00:18:02,370
But remember, don’t uproot them.

304
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:05,010
And this furnace

305
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:08,130
is my greeting gift for you.

306
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,450
Thank you, Teacher !

307
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,570
During my seclusion,

308
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:15,450
if you have any questions about alchemy,

309
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,170
go find your Grandteacher.

310
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:19,370
She is very kind

311
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:21,410
and will explain to you the details

312
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:24,130
about the inner workings of alchemy.

313
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:25,650
Alright,

314
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:27,690
I should go now.

315
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:29,210
Just a heads up,

316
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:32,010
you’re still young

317
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,890
so while I’m in seclusion,

318
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:35,250
take good care of yourself

319
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:38,330
and remember to never cut corners.

320
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:43,850
This small pill furnace

321
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:48,530
is the same quality as the Hundred Beasts Spirit Furnace I traded for in the Sea of Devils.

322
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:51,330
This cheap Master of yours

323
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:52,610
is surprisingly kind.

324
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:17,770
Teacher, Teacher !

325
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:19,530
I have a disciple !

326
00:19:32,620 --> 00:19:36,750
I've had my share of wounds,

327
00:19:34,660 --> 00:19:36,750
now I want to fight back.

328
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:40,310
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

329
00:19:40,140 --> 00:19:46,230
that's blocking all my hopes

330
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:46,230
for life ?

331
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:51,990
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

332
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:51,990
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

333
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:55,390
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

334
00:19:55,500 --> 00:20:01,390
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

335
00:19:58,220 --> 00:20:01,390
out of reach.

336
00:20:02,500 --> 00:20:06,870
Immortals

337
00:20:03,540 --> 00:20:06,870
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

338
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:10,910
Renegades

339
00:20:07,660 --> 00:20:10,910
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

340
00:20:10,660 --> 00:20:14,750
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

341
00:20:12,610 --> 00:20:14,750
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

342
00:20:14,740 --> 00:20:18,870
because I don't see the harm in that.

343
00:20:20,620 --> 00:20:26,670
My new body opens its eyes

344
00:20:23,140 --> 00:20:26,670
and awakens from its dream.

345
00:20:26,540 --> 00:20:34,230
I have overcome many trials

346
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:34,230
to get this body back.

347
00:20:34,180 --> 00:20:41,870
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

348
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:41,870
I can still see.

349
00:20:42,020 --> 00:20:51,230
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

350
00:20:45,980 --> 00:20:51,230
by my own hands.

351
00:21:06,420 --> 00:21:12,630
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

352
00:21:09,140 --> 00:21:12,630
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

353
00:21:12,380 --> 00:21:20,190
With a flick of a finger,

354
00:21:13,820 --> 00:21:20,190
only my indomitable heart remains.

355
00:21:19,980 --> 00:21:29,590
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

356
00:21:25,940 --> 00:21:29,590
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

357
00:21:29,580 --> 00:21:37,430
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

358
00:21:32,100 --> 00:21:37,430
like the descent of a god.
